[' Below is an example implementation of the `ConditionErrorLogger` in Java using Akka Actors for asynchronous processing, Apache Avro for structured logging, and Redis for rate limiting. Note that this is a simplified example and should be adapted to suit your specific use case and environment.

```java
import akka.actor.ActorSystem;
