}
```

4. LoadBalancer Interface:
Implement a dynamic load balancing mechanism to efficiently distribute incoming data streams.

```java
public interface LoadBalancer {
    DataSource selectDataSource();
}
```

5. DataIngestionManager Class:
Manage the overall pipeline by integrating different components.

```java
public class DataIngestionManager<T> implements Runnable {
    private final DataPreprocessor<T> preprocessor;
    private final DataStore<T> dataStore;
    private final LoadBalancer loadBalancer;

    // Constructor, initialize components using DI

    @Override
    public void run() {
        while (true) {
            T data = loadDataFromDataSource();
            data = preprocessor.preprocess(data);
            dataStore.saveData(data);
        }
    }

    private T loadDataFromDataSource() {
        return loadBalancer.selectDataSource().readData();
    }
}
```

